stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    state "Pending 待处理" as PENDING
    state "Approve 已批准" as APPROVED
    state "To Do 待办" as TODO
    state "Done 完成" as DONE
    state "Cancelled 已取消" as CANCELLED

    [*] --> PENDING : 创建（仅 Administrator）
    PENDING --> APPROVED : 批准
    APPROVED --> TODO : 排期进入待办
    TODO --> DONE : 完成
    PENDING --> CANCELLED : 取消
    APPROVED --> CANCELLED : 取消
    TODO --> CANCELLED : 取消
    DONE --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]

    note right of PENDING
        所有迁移仅 Administrator 可触发
        Viewer 只读（页面隐藏 + 服务端再校验）
        每次迁移写入 history（谁/何时/从→到）
    end note
    note left of DONE
        Done / Cancelled 为终态
        TRANSITIONS 中目标数组为空
    end note
